pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 수학기간 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;순천대 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2013. 3. 4.(월) ~ 6. 19.(수)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;충북대 :&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2013. 3. 4.(월) ~ 6. 14.(금)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; - 1개 학기 단위로 수학(졸업까지 타대학에서 2개 학기 이내로 수학 가능)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3. 등록금 : 금오공과대학교에 납부 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 신청서 제출장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">소속 종합학사행정실<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2013. 1. 9(수) ~ 1. 11(금)<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">6. 제출서류 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 타대학수학신청원(첨부파일 확인) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;2. 성적증명서<br>&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">7. 신청학점 : 18학점 이내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">※ 타대학 수학 신청시 유의사항 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">선수과목 이수여부를 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">한 후 신청(첨부파일 확인)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. “</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">8학기차졸업예정자”</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 및 “</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2013학년도 2학기 타대학 편입학 예정자”</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">는&nbsp;신청 불가</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 이미 이수한 교과목과 동일한 교과목의 학점은 인정하지 않음</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">(재수강 불가)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">8. 문의전화 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 각 학부(과) 종합학사행정실 전화번호</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"328\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"28\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">구&nbsp;&nbsp; 분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"253\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"28\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">연락처(☎478-&nbsp; )</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"c